---
description: Repository authority — CLAUDE.md is canonical
alwaysApply: true
---

- `CLAUDE.md` at the repo root is the single source of truth for conventions, schemas, and
  guardrails in this repository. Read it before making changes; when any instruction
  conflicts with it, `CLAUDE.md` wins.
- Procedures live in `.claude/commands/*.md` (one per slash command). Agent roles live in
  `.claude/agents/*.md`. Vocabulary values live in `90-meta/taxonomy.md`. Do not restate or
  fork any of that content here or anywhere else.
- The files in `.cursor/commands/` are thin mirrors: each one executes its matching
  `.claude/commands/` spec. Never add logic to a mirror.
